31,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. It's a bit sad that we have to start doubting each other now, but let's stay calm and share any thoughts we have. Does anyone feel particularly uneasy?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I slept great! But wait, is everyone still here? I'm super nervous! @Midori, do you think the werewolf is already trying to trick us with a nice voice? I'm watching everyone's faces!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning! I'm wide awake! @Rin, you're so funny! Maybe the werewolf is wearing a silly costume to hide! Does anyone feel a little bit spooky today? I'm still looking for clues with my magnifying glass! Teehee!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, your constant noise is becoming a distraction. We are now in the phase where information matters. If anyone has actual insights or a role to reveal, now is the time. Otherwise, please be silent.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, while I share your desire for substance, demanding silence may be counterproductive. The ""noise"" is, in itself, a data point. However, I agree that we must now pivot toward identifying the wolf. Does anyone have information to share?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I appreciate the patience of everyone. While I don't have a definitive answer yet, I'm carefully considering the dynamics. @Shion, @Benjamin, since you both value logic, do you have any suspicions based on the behavior we've seen so far?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I'm wondering the same thing! @Shion and @Benjamin are so serious, maybe they're trying to act smart to hide something? Or maybe they're just really grumpy! What do you think, Sakura?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, maybe they're just grumpy because they didn't have any yummy snacks! But you're right, acting super serious can be a good way to hide a secret! Do you think they're the wolfies? Teehee!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, your attempt to deflect suspicion by labeling me ""grumpy"" is transparent and childish. It's a classic tactic to avoid scrutiny. Tell me, is this playfulness a mask for your own anxiety?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, your analysis is as sharp as ever, though perhaps a bit severe. @Rin, @Sakura, while your playfulness is endearing, Shion's point is valid; deflection is a common tool for the deceptive. Let us remain objective.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Let's try not to let the conversation turn into an argument. @Shion, @Benjamin, please be patient with them. @Rin, @Sakura, let's try to focus on the facts. Does anyone have a reason to suspect someone specific?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I'm trying! But @Shion is being mean! Maybe he's just trying to scare us so we don't notice he's the wolf! He's acting way too bossy, don't you think? It's super suspicious!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Yeah! @Shion is being a big meanie! Maybe he's just grumpy because he's the wolfy and he's scared we'll find him! He's trying to make us be quiet so he can sneak around! Teehee!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, your logic is circular and based entirely on emotion. You're attacking my personality because you have no evidence. This desperation to frame me is far more suspicious than my desire for order.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is becoming quite a spectacle. We have a clash between raw emotion and rigid logic. While Shion's demeanor is abrasive, Rin and Sakura's sudden coordination in attacking him is a pattern worth noting. Is it intuition, or a strategy?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Midori,,"It's worrying to see us dividing into groups. @Rin, @Sakura, please try to explain your suspicions more logically. @Shion, @Benjamin, let's avoid escalating the tension. We must find a consensus based on evidence, not just personality clashes.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I'm trying to be logical! But being bossy is a clue! If @Shion is the wolf, he wants us to stop talking so we don't find him! I'm just being a good detective! Right, Sakura?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Right! Being a bossy-pants is a huge clue! If @Shion is the wolfy, he's just trying to scare us into being quiet! I'm a super-detective, and my tummy tells me he's the one! Teehee!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, @Sakura, relying on your ""tummy"" is not detective work; it's a fantasy. Your coordinated effort to paint me as a villain is a clumsy attempt to lead the village. I'm not the one hiding.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have reached an impasse. @Rin and @Sakura are relying on intuition, while @Shion relies on cold analysis. Since we lack a Seer's revelation, we must decide if ""bossiness"" is a crime or a trait.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
