64,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It's heartbreaking to see Shion gone, and now Benjamin as well. We've lost two people so quickly. Please, let's stay calm. We must be more careful now, as the werewolf is still among us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Benjamin is gone too?! This is getting really scary! @Midori, we have to be super careful! If the wolf is still here, they're just picking us off one by one! Who could it be?!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"It's so scary! Poor Benjamin! Maybe the wolfy is just really hungry! @Midori, @Rin, we have to hold hands and be brave! Do you think the wolfy is trying to trick us again? Teehee!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Midori,,"It is very frightening, but we must stay focused. Since Benjamin was attacked, we know the werewolf is still here. @Rin, @Sakura, let's think carefully. Is there anything that seems out of place now?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I'm thinking really hard! Since Benjamin was the one attacked, he definitely wasn't the wolf! But wait... if the wolf is still here, they must be pretending to be our friend! @Sakura, do you feel anything spooky?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, I don't know! Everything feels super spooky now! But @Midori is always so nice and calm, and @Rin is my bestie! Maybe the wolfy is just a ghost now? Teehee! Wait, that's not how it works, right?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Midori,,"It's not a ghost, Sakura. The werewolf is definitely one of us three. I've been watching everything closely. @Rin, @Sakura, since we are the only ones left, we must be honest with each other to survive.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm being honest! I really want us to win! But @Midori, you're so calm even though we're almost out of people. Isn't that a little bit weird? Like you're not even scared because you know what's happening?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Rin, that's a really good point! @Midori is super-duper calm, like she's reading a book instead of playing a scary game! Are you hiding a secret, Midori? Teehee! My detective tummy is tingling again!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I understand why it might seem that way, but I'm simply trying to stay composed for all of us. If I panic, we can't think clearly. I promise I'm on your side. Please, let's trust each other.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I want to trust you, Midori, I really do! But the wolfy is super sneaky! If we trust the wrong person, it's game over! @Sakura, do you think Midori is telling the truth, or is she just being a super-actor?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, that's a tough one! Midori is so nice, but being a super-actor is part of the game, right? Maybe she's just a really good friend, or maybe she's the wolfy in disguise! Teehee! What do you think, Rin?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
